dWVsa0tXekE0bzVJQllFWXdBcHlUaFEwQlRhR2tPcFVDT0hvN3lMcEZndWlGNmIxRWc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-25","zh":""},{"title":"FIS Oct 2026 30.000 call (FIS261023C00030000) Stock Price, News, Quote & History","src":"Yahoo! Finance Canada","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE8waU9rTEtUT05IVWpsMWlUWWhaVG90UzUwLTU0RjFvcW1JeWlPaHhkTVpLSGNXX2w0cFdxSjhPMHdCQWM3TElOYnNsR21DcFhVR3dXanE3QWRoVlRWZG5JQ091WlI?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"FIS 2026 年 10 月 30.000 買權 (FIS261023C00030000) 股票價格、新聞、報價和歷史"}],"order_news":[],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1136893/000113689326000013/fis-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"FIS is a financial technology company providing solutions to financial institutions, businesses and developers. We unlock financial technology to the world across the money lifecycle underpinning the world's financial systems. Our people are dedicated to advancing the way the world pays, banks and invests, by helping our clients to confidently run, grow and protect their businesses. Our expertise comes from decades of experience helping financial institutions and businesses of all sizes adapt to meet the needs of their customers by harnessing where reliability meets innovation in financial technology. Headquartered in Jacksonville, Florida, FIS is a member of the Fortune 500 and the Standard & Poor's 500 Index. FIS is incorporated under the laws of the State of Georgia as Fidelity National Information Services, Inc., and our stock is traded under the trading symbol \"FIS\" on the New York ","zh":"FIS 是一家為金融機構、企業和開發商提供解決方案的金融科技公司。我們在支撐世界金融體系的貨幣生命週期中向世界開放金融科技。我們的員工致力於幫助我們的客戶自信地經營、發展和保護他們的業務，從而推動世界支付、銀行和投資方式的發展。我們的專業知識源自數十年的經驗，幫助各種規模的金融機構和企業利用可靠性與金融科技創新來適應滿足客戶的需求。 FIS 總部位於佛羅裡達州傑克遜維爾，是財富 500 強和標準普爾 500 指數的成員。 FIS 根據喬治亞州法律註冊成立，名稱為 Fidelity National Information Services, Inc.，我們的股票在紐約證券交易所以交易代碼“FIS”進行交易"},{"en":"Our growth continues to be driven by the expansion of our clients' businesses, our internal development of innovative solutions, our focused sales and marketing efforts and our deepening reach across global financial ecosystems. Strategic acquisitions and partnerships have further enhanced our offerings, diversified our client portfolio, and expanded our reach into new and attractive markets aligned with our long-term objectives. As we advance our transformation into a platform company, we are embedding artificial intelligence (\"AI\") across our solutions and operations. We have shifted to a functional operating model, streamlining decision-making, fostering closer collaboration across the organization and with our clients. By reallocating resources toward high-value, integrated client experiences and modernizing our technology infrastructure, we are strengthening our competitive position","zh":"我們的成長持續受到客戶業務擴張、創新解決方案的內部開發、我們專注的銷售和行銷工作以及我們在全球金融生態系統中不斷深化的影響力的推動。策略性收購和合作夥伴關係進一步增強了我們的產品，使我們的客戶組合多樣化，並將我們的業務範圍擴大到符合我們長期目標的新的、有吸引力的市場。隨著我們推動向平台公司的轉型，我們正在將人工智慧（“AI”）嵌入到我們的解決方案和營運中。我們已經轉向職能營運模式，簡化決策，促進整個組織以及與客戶的更密切合作。透過將資源重新分配給高價值、整合的客戶體驗以及現代化我們的技術基礎設施，我們正在加強我們的競爭地位"},{"en":"On January 31, 2024, we completed the sale (the \"2024 Worldpay Sale\") of a 55% equity interest in our Worldpay Merchant Solutions business to private equity funds managed by GTCR, LLC (such funds, the \"Buyer\"). FIS retained a non-controlling 45% equity interest in a new standalone joint venture, Worldpay Holdco, LLC (\"Worldpay\"), following the closing of the 2024 Worldpay Sale. In connection with the 2024 Worldpay Sale, FIS and Worldpay entered into commercial agreements, preserving a key value proposition for clients of both businesses and reducing potential dis-synergies. FIS and Worldpay also entered into additional agreements as described in Note 4 to the consolidated financial statements.","zh":"2024 年 1 月 31 日，我們完成了將 Worldpay Merchant Solutions 業務 55% 的股權出售（「2024 年 Worldpay 出售」）給 GTCR, LLC 管理的私募股權基金（此類基金，「買方」）。 2024 年 Worldpay 出售結束後，FIS 保留了新的獨立合資企業 Worldpay Holdco, LLC（「Worldpay」）的非控股 45% 股權。在 2024 年 Worldpay 銷售中，FIS 和 Worldpay 簽訂了商業協議，為兩家企業的客戶保留了關鍵價值主張，並減少了潛在的協同效應。 FIS 和 Worldpay 也簽訂了合併財務報表附註 4 所述的附加協議。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our sales personnel have expertise in particular solutions, geographic markets and industry verticals, as well as across our various client segments. We believe that focusing our expertise on clients in specific markets and tailoring integrated solution sets to participants in those markets enables us to better serve our clients and makes our offerings more attractive to prospects. The majority of our prospects are identified via direct and/or indirect field sales, as well as inbound and outbound lead generation, telesales and virtual sales efforts.","zh":"我們的銷售人員擁有特定解決方案、地理市場和垂直行業以及各個客戶群的專業知識。我們相信，將我們的專業知識集中在特定市場的客戶身上，並為這些市場的參與者量身定制整合解決方案集，使我們能夠更好地為客戶服務，並使我們的產品對潛在客戶更具吸引力。我們的大多數潛在客戶是透過直接和/或間接現場銷售以及入站和出站潛在客戶開發、電話銷售和虛擬銷售工作來確定的。"},{"en":"Our global marketing team develops and leads the execution of global, role-specific and geography-based strategic marketing plans in support of the segments' reputation and relationship building goals in addition to their revenue and profitability goals. Key components of our strategic plans include brand amplification and digital enablement; market and competitive research; voice of the customer and client engagement; thought leadership; integrated go-to-market programs; internal communications and readiness; journalists and social media engagement; industry analyst relations; client events; trade shows; high-touch client programs; demand generation campaigns; account- and deal-based marketing programs; collateral development and management across digital and online channels; and the launch of new products to market.","zh":"我們的全球行銷團隊制定並領導執行全球、特定角色和基於地理位置的策略行銷計劃，以支援各部門的聲譽和關係建立目標以及收入和盈利目標。我們策略計畫的關鍵組成部分包括品牌擴張和數位化支援；市場和競爭研究；客戶的聲音和客戶參與度；思想領導力；綜合上市計劃；內部溝通和準備情況；記者和社交媒體參與；行業分析師關係；客戶活動；貿易展覽；高接觸客戶程序；需求激發活動；基於帳戶和交易的營銷計劃；跨數字和在線渠道的附屬開發和管理；以及向市場開發和管理；"}],"competition":[{"en":"The markets for our solutions are intensely competitive across both established companies and new industry entrants. Depending on the business line, our primary competitors include, but are not limited to, internal technology or software development departments within financial institutions or other large companies; global and regional companies providing banking, payment and capital markets solutions and services; embedded payment solution providers; securities exchanges; asset managers; card associations; clearing networks or associations; trust companies; independent computer services firms; companies that develop verticalized software applications; companies owned by global banks selling competitive solutions; companies that provide customized development, implementation and support services; emerging technology innovators and business process outsourcing companies. Many of these com","zh":"無論是老牌公司還是新產業進入者，我們解決方案的市場競爭都非常激烈。根據業務線，我們的主要競爭對手包括但不限於金融機構或其他大公司的內部技術或軟體開發部門；提供銀行、支付和資本市場解決方案和服務的全球和區域公司；嵌入式支付解決方案提供商；證券交易所；資產管理人；卡協會；清算網路或協會；信託公司；獨立的計算機服務公司；開發其中許多都是"},{"en":"Our technology development activities primarily relate to enhancing our proprietary core processing software applications and to designing and developing next-generation digital solutions, processing systems, software applications and risk management platforms, including componentized products with unified API-enabled access implemented on a cloud foundation. These development activities include modernizing our online product offerings for treasury services, digital banking, capital markets services, and our next-generation core banking platform. We expect to continue investing an appropriate level of resources to maintain, enhance and extend the functionality of our proprietary systems and software applications, to develop new and innovative software applications and systems to address emerging technology trends in response to the needs of our clients, and to enhance the resilience of o","zh":"我们的技术开发活动主要涉及增强我们专有的核心处理软件应用程序，以及设计和开发下一代数字解决方案、处理系统、软件应用程序和风险管理平台，包括在云基础上实施的具有统一API支持访问的组件化产品。這些開發活動包括使我們的財務服務、數位銀行、資本市場服務和下一代核心銀行平台的線上產品現代化。我們期望繼續投入適當水準的資源來維護、增強和擴展我們專有系統和軟體應用程式的功能，開發新的創新軟體應用程式和系統，以應對新興技術趨勢，以滿足客戶的需求，並增強我們的彈性"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Banking Solutions","val":7285000000,"zh":"銀行解決方案"},{"name":"Capital Market Solutions","val":3196000000,"zh":"資本市場解決方案"}],"total":10677000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":8306000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"Non North America","val":2371000000,"zh":"非北美地區"}],"total":10677000000}},"peers":["GPN","FISV","EFX","JKHY","FTV"]}}